ou described. \r\nBut I think you missunderstood the problem we have. \r\n\r\nIt´s not that is a jump/lag in the begining of the stream. It happens at the end of every chunk, that is every 10 seconds.\r\n\r\nI just confirmed that it´s still a problem after changing our code. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/436913228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Curwer-zz","id":2364298,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjQyOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2364298?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz","html_url":"https://github.com/Curwer-zz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Curwer-zz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1953652833,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MTk1MzY1MjgzMw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/1953652833","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use